<!-- ===================== ABOUT ===================== -->
<section class="about-section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-kicker">About The Project</span>
      <h2>Understanding Your Respiratory Health</h2>
      <p>
        The Lung Disease Predictor is a web application designed to analyze your symptoms and provide
        preliminary insights into potential lung conditions. A Random Forest classifier trained on thousands of
        clinically patterned cases estimates the most likely condition and confidence score.
      </p>
